  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "B04a pilot scope and batch status",
      "items": [
        "Pilot batch for streaming/speech/media gateway flows (B04 split). Covers representative endpoints from streaming, speech, and media modules; not full 818-route coverage.",
        "Left side = API endpoints (method+path). Middle = controllers/gateways. Right middle = services. Right = downstream microservices/APIs/storage.",
        "Full B04 follow-up should cover storage, storage-access-key, voice-profile, admin-transcription, text task/stream routes, and all remaining endpoint-level nodes with reconciled counts from inventory/catalog."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Example Input / Output (per key node)",
      "items": [
        "ep_transcribe (POST /audio/transcription-jobs/transcribe): Input = multipart/form-data `file` (audio) + fields from TranscribeFileRequest (e.g., consultationId?, agentSlug?, language?, clinicianUserId? for machine callers). Output = BatchTranscribeResponse {id, status, sseUrl, audioUri, agentSlug?, agentVersionId?, warnings?}.",
        "ep_stream (POST /audio/transcription-jobs/stream/session): Input = CreateStreamSessionRequest (consultationId or workflowSlug, agentSlug?, language/languageMode?, context?). Output = StreamSessionResponse (session/ticket/connection metadata; warnings? when optional ASR stages are degraded off).",
        "ep_text (POST /text-generations/generate): Input = TextGenerateRequest {prompt, system_prompt? (deprecated), agentSlug?, temperature?, max_tokens?, top_p?, frequency_penalty?, presence_penalty?, stream?, response_format?, context?, reasoning?}; raw provider/model pinning is refused on business plane. Output = sync JSON from TEXT or gateway streaming ack/task mapping depending on stream mode.",
        "ep_speech (POST /speech/synthesize): Input = SpeechSynthesizeRequest {input, voice?, response_format? pcm|wav|mp3, speed?, stream_format? audio|sse, model?, agentSlug?}; gateway injects resolved_spec/provider_overrides. Output = streamed audio bytes or SSE; headers carry TTS metadata (provider, characters, audio seconds where available).",
        "ep_media (POST /media): Input = multipart/form-data `file` (attachment MIME or audio MIME allow-list). Output = {mediaId, mime, sizeBytes, sha256}. GET /media/:mediaId returns same reference metadata, never bytes/URL/location."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Evidence and verification notes",
      "items": [
        "Repository: https://github.com/ArcaAI/project-hope.git @ 8cb2e5e8e6bbddf5ee7c676782ebb5ad683c23a0 (repo root /Users/apple/repos/VOX/project-hope). Sources are repo-relative paths/lines/function labels verified against local tree during batch authoring.",
        "Downstream service URLs are config-driven (TEXT_URL, TTS_URL, STT_URL) with local default patterns seen in code/tests (e.g., 8862/8865/8861); runtime values depend on deployment config.",
        "TtsWsGateway exact handler lines should be rechecked in a follow-up pass if deeper WS method-level evidence is required; class/file source included.",
        "Limitations: representative endpoint nodes (not every route in B04 scope), example I/O summarized from DTOs/controller contracts and placed in cards because architecture node schema has no dedicated example fields; Archify passport still exposes sources/relationships per node."
      ]
    }
